Subject: what is RRO really about?
Message-ID: <S4e5ANNBpyw.xmVqFbE46a0J@rropen.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rropen/c/S4e5ANNBpyw/m/xmVqFbE46a0J>
